<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NCR rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NCR rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst Steve Milunovich said he assigned an outperform rating to shares of NCR Corp with a six to 12-month price target of $40 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 32-1/2 on the NYSE early Monday.</p>
</text>
